  "question": {
    "text": "Set of all the values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> satisfying the inequality <math><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math> is",
